// # OpenOODA stock catalog
//
// Logline: Seed packages for opm search and add. Not a public api_surface dir.
//
// Setup: Each child folder is one package (manifest + payload). catalog is the search index.
//        opm search reads this file first. opm add uses these folders when the name hits.
//        Rebuild the catalog with: opm bot seed
//
// Beats:
//   1. hello — print hello.
//   2. echo — print echo.
//   3. catalog — name|version|caps|deps|sha lines.
